  subheadline="Pumps, Pressure & Equipment Electrical"
  heroDescription="Pressure washers, pumps, air conditioners, hot tubs. They all need dedicated circuits and proper electrical hookups to run safely and efficiently. GP Electric handles the electrical side so your equipment performs the way it should."
